{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他怕一往前做就会把刚找回的温柔磨掉，便想退回安宁里护住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种生活的牵挂继续往前做，发现眼前的事也在替它争取，旧愿反而近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿近了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再嫌自己肩上有事还惦记那种生活，发现这份惦记和眼前该做的事都推着他向前，心里很高兴。\",\n      \"key\": \"都推着他\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又尝到当初相信那种生活时的快乐，知道这份快乐是真的，却还没真正过上那样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐是真的\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再使劲也未必能让那种生活回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"再使劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他愿意为那种生活吃苦，也会想想再使劲会不会把刚找回的温柔搭进去。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿意吃苦\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"真到了要承受代价的时候，他还是可能累得想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"承受代价\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"他松了口气，不再反复找理由证明自己该往前，仍清楚知道那种生活是自己想要的。\",\n      \"key\": \"松了口气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留过去想退回安宁保护旧愿、如今发现行动也能保护旧愿的关键反转。用害怕磨掉温柔说明过去为何想退，R67与R68重复的行动理由合并到眼前的事也在替旧愿争取。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确写回两种心意共同推动他向前的变化，也保留由此产生的喜悦，以及他不再嫌弃自己承担责任时仍惦记旧愿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"补回最初相信生活时的快乐重新出现，并明确这份快乐是真实的，却不等于愿望已经实现。他珍惜已有的满足，也没有拿它遮住仍未实现的生活需要。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留投入更多也不能保证旧愿实现的限制，把重复的结果不确定性压缩为一条。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留愿望不能让任何代价都自动值得、需要留意怎样坚持的认识，并把哪些值得付出、哪些不能丢掉落实为愿意吃苦却不愿搭进刚找回的温柔。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来仍可能因代价疲惫、重新想退回安宁的风险，不再用两种渴望仍有冲突的抽象总结代替具体担忧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-8\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再反复寻找向前的证明，并补出压力松开后仍清楚知道自己想要什么的心理变化，使结尾的安静与清晰都有原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b387e10e-0a76-4292-b298-141d6a97e8e2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T004153449120Z", "elapsed_seconds": 191.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:45:04.758763+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9f6e7c1c9a0cc98a53095254b4e3265d370ad527d3a049c1342eaf332cbbeec0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-2